x;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.674ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 298 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>'. If the dipole is placed in a uniform electric field '<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"2.106ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -931 764 931\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(483.5,241) translate(-250 0)\"><use data-c=\"AF\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-AF\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>'; in such a way that dipole axis makes a very small angle with the electric field, '<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.729ex\" height=\"2.106ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -931 764 931\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(483.5,241) translate(-250 0)\"><use data-c=\"AF\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-AF\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>'. The angular frequency of the oscillations of the dipole when released is given by:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.199ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.061ex\" height=\"4.208ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1330.1 2679.1 1860\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msqrt\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0,120.1)\"><use data-c=\"221A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-221A\"></use></g><g transform=\"translate(1020,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,477.2) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(960,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D438\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D438\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(237,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1378,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D459\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D459\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1419.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><rect width=\"1659.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"1020\" y=\"1210.1\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>"},{"identifier":"B","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.199ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.061ex\" height=\"4.208ex\" role=\"img\" 